WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:02.120
Breach simulation armed.

00:02.720 --> 00:04.640
Scanning code, routes, and dependencies.

00:05.240 --> 00:07.640
The mission is clear: build defenders.

00:09.200 --> 00:13.560
In a world where over 3.5 million
cybersecurity roles sit empty

00:14.480 --> 00:20.400
and a single preventable mistake
costs millions, theory isn't enough.

00:20.800 --> 00:25.520
Enter SCaLE, the ultimate
cybersecurity training pipeline.

00:25.800 --> 00:27.920
Scan, simulate, learn.

00:28.560 --> 00:32.160
Upload source code and instantly
hunt down live threats.

00:32.920 --> 00:38.120
SQL injection, cross-site scripting,
every core vulnerability,

00:38.760 --> 00:42.160
real exploitation paths,
real remediation evidence.

00:42.480 --> 00:43.640
Step into the arena.

00:44.000 --> 00:46.760
Red team attacks, blue team defends.

00:47.120 --> 00:50.840
Submit your fix, pass the test,
and dominate the leaderboard.

00:51.600 --> 00:52.080
Stuck?

00:52.960 --> 00:57.480
Our advanced AI breaks down every
simulation step by step, turning

00:57.520 --> 01:00.160
common mistakes into absolute mastery.

01:00.720 --> 01:02.120
It's time to step up.
